('','vaxia_governance.settings','a:31:{s:5:\"_core\";a:1:{s:19:\"default_config_hash\";s:43:\"kqjQGQKrfRKVVbLuU16k8sFk0bguErmFjE3lp4LH9LU\";}s:18:\"proposal_node_help\";s:0:\"\";s:23:\"proposal_open_timeframe\";s:7:\"2 weeks\";s:25:\"proposal_active_timeframe\";s:7:\"2 weeks\";s:24:\"proposal_voter_timeframe\";s:8:\"6 months\";s:22:\"proposal_required_perc\";s:2:\"50\";s:19:\"anon_mailer_webform\";i:11;s:16:\"anon_mailer_form\";i:125;s:13:\"election_rate\";s:6:\"1 year\";s:18:\"election_positions\";s:36:\"Setting Lead\nSocial Lead\nSystem Lead\";s:20:\"election_term_limits\";b:1;s:26:\"election_term_limit_limits\";s:1:\"2\";s:13:\"election_role\";s:4:\"lead\";s:22:\"election_default_forum\";i:105;s:23:\"election_election_intro\";s:174:\"Each year we have an rpg_election for key positions on our site. This is so that we can always be sure that the current leadership is connected to and trusted by our players.\";s:17:\"election_min_numb\";b:1;s:21:\"election_min_numb_val\";s:1:\"2\";s:17:\"election_min_perc\";b:1;s:21:\"election_min_perc_val\";s:2:\"50\";s:15:\"election_runoff\";b:1;s:24:\"election_position_counts\";a:3:{s:12:\"setting_lead\";i:2;s:11:\"social_lead\";i:2;s:11:\"system_lead\";i:2;}s:23:\"election_position_descs\";a:3:{s:12:\"setting_lead\";s:523:\"<b>Setting:</b> The setting department is responsible for the development and maintenance of the game settings of this site. It creates and maintains documentation on the settings, stored publicly in the wiki, and provides training on setting details. It also approves world-changing sessions and sagas proposed by storyhosts and resolves any consistency issues between existing plots and sessions. The setting department confirms whether a thing exists in a setting, but is not responsible for the system mechanics for it.\";s:11:\"social_lead\";s:430:\"<b>Social:</b> The social department is responsible for maintaining the health of the community. This includes moderation duties, interpersonal conflict resolution, communication assistance, helping newbies, creating and maintaining site and newbie tutorials and running community activities. In addition, the social department may act as a neutral party in disputes, assuming the department itself is not in conflict of interest.\";s:11:\"system_lead\";s:508:\"<b>System:</b> The system department is responsible for the game mechanics and overall game balance of the system as implemented in the settings of this site. This includes creating and maintaining documentation on rules, training new ASHs and keeping existing SHs trained regularly, as well as maintaining the Apprentice Storyhost Course. The system department implements numbers and rules for in-game elements the setting department has confirmed exist, but does not confirm their existence in the setting.\";}s:18:\"election_run_roles\";a:1:{s:11:\"storyteller\";s:11:\"storyteller\";}s:11:\"departments\";s:21:\"Setting\nSocial\nSystem\";s:16:\"department_roles\";a:3:{s:7:\"setting\";s:17:\"knows_the_setting\";s:6:\"social\";s:16:\"knows_the_social\";s:6:\"system\";s:16:\"knows_the_system\";}s:26:\"department_vacation_cutoff\";s:7:\"2 weeks\";s:21:\"department_join_forms\";a:3:{s:6:\"social\";i:14;s:7:\"setting\";i:15;s:6:\"system\";i:16;}s:19:\"walkthrough_quizzes\";a:3:{s:6:\"system\";i:6;s:7:\"setting\";i:7;s:6:\"social\";i:8;}s:14:\"role_app_roles\";a:2:{i:0;s:11:\"storyteller\";i:1;s:8:\"mediator\";}s:24:\"application_approval_min\";s:2:\"75\";s:17:\"role_app_settings\";a:2:{s:11:\"storyteller\";a:4:{s:4:\"quiz\";a:1:{i:0;i:5;}s:8:\"eligible\";s:21:\"storyteller_candidate\";s:4:\"view\";a:2:{i:0;s:11:\"storyteller\";i:1;s:4:\"lead\";}s:7:\"approve\";a:2:{i:0;s:11:\"storyteller\";i:1;s:4:\"lead\";}}s:8:\"mediator\";a:4:{s:4:\"quiz\";a:1:{i:0;i:9;}s:8:\"eligible\";s:21:\"eligible_for_mediator\";s:4:\"view\";a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"lead\";i:1;s:8:\"mediator\";}s:7:\"approve\";a:1:{i:0;s:8:\"mediator\";}}}}'),
