('items',0,106,106,'en',0,'A knot of red thread, iron nails and a saint\'s medal. Something about it keeps the dark at arm\'s length.','wiki'),
('items',0,107,107,'en',0,'A grey-muzzled bloodhound who growls at empty doorways.','wiki'),
