(132,132,'en',1,'Social Department','Social department forums. If you would like to post on these forums you will need to become a member of the Social department. If you would like to do that please take (and pass) the <a href=\"/quizzes/new-player-social-walkthrough\">Social training walkthrough</a>','plain_text',1795742688,1,1),
(133,133,'en',1,'System Department','System department forums. If you would like to post on these forums you will need to become a member of the System department. If you would like to do that please take (and pass) the <a href=\"/quizzes/new-player-system-walkthrough\">System training walkthrough</a>.','plain_text',1795742688,1,1),
